<title>UK: Bancaja unit sets $200 million 10-year step-up FRN.</title>
<headline>Bancaja unit sets $200 million 10-year step-up FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following subordinated floating-rate issue was announced by joint lead managers Salomon Brothers and Merrill Lynch.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANCAJA INTERNATIONAL CAPITAL</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  CAJA DE AHORROS DE VALENCIA, CASTELLON Y ALICANTE,</p>
<p>		BANCAJA</p>
<p> AMT    $200 MLN	BASE     **3M-LIBOR  MATURITY  **23.JUL.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN   **+40 BP    PAY DATE    23.JUL.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY =	   ISS PRICE  99.57     FULL FEES   40 BP</p>
<p> LAST IBCA  A	   REOFFER    99.57</p>
<p> NOTES    **CALLABLE FROM JUL.02 AT PAR, WHEN COUPON STEPS UP TO</p>
<p>		3M LIBOR +90 BP</p>
<p>DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/ES/CI  NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  SPAIN     TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    20 BP     SELL CONC  20 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
